How to Deploy
Copy the rule files to /var/ossec/etc/rules/.

Copy the decoder file to /var/ossec/etc/decoders/local_decoder.xml.

Ensure the CDB list suspicious-programs exists in /var/ossec/etc/lists/.

Restart the Wazuh manager:

bash
sudo systemctl restart wazuh-manager
Verify rules and decoders are loaded:

bash
sudo /var/ossec/bin/wazuh-logtest
